op"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;9,356,919&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Net deferred income tax liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;46,967,696&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"/&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;47,710,030&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%"&gt;6. COMMITMENTS AND CONTINGENCIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;At December 31, 2025, CIP did not have any contracts with remaining commitments for operations and maintenance. From time to time, CIP is involved in various claims and lawsuits regarding matters arising in the ordinary course of business. At December 31, 2025, there were no outstanding legal proceedings against CIP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%"&gt;7. RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Operations and Maintenance Services Agreement&#8212;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;In October 2008, CIP entered into an operating and maintenance agreement for a pipeline interconnection with Cameron LNG JV. Cameron LNG JV owns the interconnection and metering facilities and CIP performs the operations and maintenance. Cameron LNG JV reimburses CIP for the costs of performing these services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Note Receivable from Affiliate&#8212; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;There is a note receivable from SI Partners at December 31, 2025 for up to $250,000,000. The note matures on December 31, 2028 and had a balance of principal and interest of $75,419,275 and $65,000,627 at December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The interest rate is an intercompany borrowing rate that is variable and is adjusted each month throughout the year. At December 31, 2025 and 2024, the interest rate on the promissory note was 5.11% and 5.01%, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Accounts Payable to Affiliates&#8212; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;CIP, in the normal course of business, enters into routine transactions with affiliates. The transactions are settled through centralized cash management, as discussed above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;The following tables show revenues and charges from/to CIP&#8217;s affiliates:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:97.023%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:51.660%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:22.366%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:22.674%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="6" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Years Ended December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Revenues from affiliate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;46,079&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top"/&