    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-10" id="fn-10" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">ASC 740 considers the equity component of AFUDC a temporary difference for which deferred income taxes must be provided. The respondent is required to record the deferred tax liability for AFUDC equity in Account 282 with a corresponding regulatory asset. The regulatory asset is itself a temporary difference for which deferred income taxes are recognized and recorded in Account 283.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Applied depreciation rate based on total transmission gas plant balances.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">General plant bases includes non-utility property. Applied depreciation rate based on total general plant balances.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Cameron Interstate Pipeline (CIP) is charged by Sempra Infrastructure Partners, LP for services such as human resources, treasury, legal, tax, property and liability insurance, other administrative functions, and for other costs incurred on its behalf. These costs are based on direct assignment to the extent practicable, or by using allocations determined by Sempra Infrastructure Partners, LP based on the utilization of services provided to or for the benefits received by CIP.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-14" id="fn-14" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Our valuation of the net excesses or deficiencies which result from shipper supplied gas, as well as the valuation of the disposition of excesses and the sources of deficiencies, is based upon the monthly index prices from the Southeast Louisiana Henry Hub.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
